Climate & Weather API Project

EPITA Engineering Tools TP2 — Group 4

A Python command-line application that retrieves live weather information using the WeatherAPI service.

Features

* Retrieves real-time weather information.
* Accepts city names through command-line arguments.
* Displays results using formatted Rich tables.
* Handles invalid cities and API connection errors.
* Loads API credentials securely from environment variables.
* Uses an isolated Python environment managed by uv.

Technologies

* Python 3.14+
* uv
* WeatherAPI
* Requests
* python-dotenv
* Rich
* Hatchling

Project Structure

src/
└── weather_app/
    ├── __init__.py
    ├── config.py
    ├── client.py
    └── cli.py
