README.md

Installation

Install dependencies:

uv sync

Create a .env file in the project root:

WEATHER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

Obtain an API key from WeatherAPI.

Usage

Check weather for a city:

uv run weather-app Paris

Display command help:

uv run weather-app --help

Security

API credentials are stored in .env and are excluded from Git using .gitignore. The .env.template file provides a placeholder for configuration.

Never commit your actual API key.

Packaging

Build the source distribution and wheel:

uv build

Validate the packages:

uv run python -m twine check dist/*

